            "titleKey": "m101-additional-issues|module|recognition|title",
            "text": "附加車道漸變起點未以穿越虛線區分主線與轉向車道，駕駛人可能忽略匯出時使用方向燈，影響其他車輛判斷。",
            "textKey": "m101-additional-issues|module|recognition|text"
          },
          {
            "id": "storage",
            "title": "漸變或儲車空間不足",
            "titleKey": "m101-additional-issues|module|storage|title",
